### livekit / client-sdk-flutter native plugin (`android/.../rtc/`, `ios/gravix_rtc/Sources/gravix_rtc/rtc/`)
Android (Kotlin) and iOS (Swift) native plugin code answering the vendored RTC
core's method channel: audio session management, audio processing,
visualizer/renderer, broadcast (iOS).
- Project: https://github.com/livekit/client-sdk-flutter (`android/`, `shared_swift/`, `ios/Classes/`)
- Version referenced: 2.13.0
- Copyright 2024 LiveKit, Inc. (upstream NOTICE)
- License: Apache-2.0 — https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
- Notes: ported and re-branded (package, class, channel and event-channel
  names); the FFT dependency was replaced by an in-tree implementation
  (`RealFft.kt`). Gravix additions: screen-capture foreground service,
  direct Apple output selection, route-change reporting, iOS music mixer.

### Background music mixing pipeline (`android/.../music/`)
Native Android audio decoder/mixer/monitor pipeline, originally authored
in-house under `com.rgn.live`, relocated and repackaged here. No third-party
license obligations beyond the WebRTC SDK it hooks into.

