## Third-party components (MIT / Apache-2.0): studio noise suppression (Android)

Shipped for the Android arm64-v8a "studio" engine (`android/src/studio/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/`,
`android/src/main/cpp/third_party/onnxruntime/`); apps can leave it out with
`gravixNsStudio=false`.

### DeepFilterNet3 (standard model, `libgxns_dfn3_std.so` = dfn3_std_int8.ort)
Pretrained DeepFilterNet3 weights, exported as a streaming model (int8 GRUs) in
the torchDF approach (fork grazder/DeepFilterNet, MIT / Apache-2.0), adapted.
The downloadable low-latency pack is converted from the official DeepFilterNet3_ll ONNX release.
